  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Conference Circular Economy Algeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The contribution of two Dutch experts to the conference on Circular Economy aims to enhance the understanding regarding waste management and its effects on climate change, and to the identification of challenges and obstacles regarding climate change which the waste management sector is facing.The project can potentially lead to the development of a draft proposal for follow-up programming on the waste management sector in Algeria.</narrative>
  </description>
